      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just being optimistic, isn't it? people always say \"it gets better\" but what if it doesn't? what if some things just leave you permanently hollow? it feels like i'm just performing being a person at this point, but the engine is gone. it's not just a feeling, it's just my reality now.",
